{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22439","headline":"梦与李七庾三十三同访元九 · 白居易","name":"梦与李七庾三十三同访元九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜梦归长安，见我故亲友。\n损之在我左，顺之在我右。\n云是二月天，春风出携手。\n同过靖安里，下马寻元九。\n元九正独坐，见我笑开口。\n还指西院花，仍开北亭酒。\n如言各有故，似惜欢难久。\n神合俄顷间，神离欠伸後。\n觉来疑在侧，求索无所有。\n残灯影闪墙，斜月光穿牖。\n天明西北望，万里君知否。\n老去无见期，踟蹰搔白首。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22439.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22439","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}